            <ArticleTitle>A case of trazodone-induced ventricular tachycardia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>388-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Trazodone was associated with the occurrence of life-threatening premature ventricular contractions and angina in a 45-year-old white man who had no prior cardiovascular disease. Caution in prescribing trazodone and in the cardiac monitoring of patients receiving trazodone is recommended.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
